#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:40
msgid ""
"Mobile REST **connects directly** to Hub (no desktop Electron `/api` proxy); "
"requires a **Service API Token** and Hub CORS for Capacitor origin (`https://"
"localhost`). Routes use hash (`#/chat`) for WebView debugging."
msgstr ""
"移动端 REST **直连** Hub（无桌面 Electron `/api` 代理）；需要 **Service API "
"Token** 以及 Hub 对 Capacitor 源（`https://localhost`）的 CORS。路由使用 hash"
"（`#/chat`）以便 WebView 调试。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub settings"
msgstr "Hub 设置"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:49
msgid ""
"Home PC: `anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`, create a Service API Token "
"(`anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap`; see [`remote-"
"access.md`](../guide/remote-access.md))."
msgstr ""
"家用 PC：`anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`，创建 Service API Token"
"（`anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap`；见 [`remote-"
"access.md`](../guide/remote-access.md)）。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:49
msgid "(Optional) `anima tunnel setup`; phone uses `https://<your-hostname>`."
msgstr "（可选）`anima tunnel setup`；手机使用 `https://<your-hostname>`。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:49
msgid "APP → **Hub settings** (`/settings`):"
msgstr "APP → **Hub 设置**（`/settings`）："

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:49
msgid "Hub URL (Tunnel domain or `http://<PC-IP>:2658`; not `127.0.0.1`)"
msgstr "Hub URL（Tunnel 域名或 `http://<PC-IP>:2658`；勿用 `127.0.0.1`）"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:49
msgid "Service API Token (`fa_at_...`, printed once at creation)"
msgstr "服务 API 令牌（`fa_at_...`，创建时仅打印一次）"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:49
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Test connection** → **Save and enter** → top bar switches **Chat** / "
#| "**Console**."
msgid ""
"**Test connection** → **Save and enter** → top bar switches **Chat** / "
"**Console**."
msgstr "**测试连接** → **保存并进入** → 顶栏切换 **聊天室** / **管理台**。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:51
msgid ""
"Non-loopback Hub URL requires token; REST uses `Authorization: Bearer`; SAP "
"sends `auth_token` in `connect` frame."
msgstr ""
"非回环 Hub URL 需要 token；REST 使用 `Authorization: Bearer`；Hub RPC 在 "
"`connect` 帧发送 `auth_token`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:60
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Symptom                             | Common cause                                                                                    |\n"
#| "| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Keyboard covers chat input          | WebView not resizing; need `adjustResize` + `@capacitor/keyboard`; `cap sync` after Web changes |\n"
#| "| Chat input unresponsive             | No selected conversation (first install should auto-create); or SAP disconnected                |\n"
#| "| **Console load failed / Failed to fetch | Hub not `--host 0.0.0.0`, wrong token, firewall; Chrome Remote Debugging for Bearer header      |\n"
#| "| Not Found                           | Avoid legacy paths like `/console/dashboard/index.html`; use SPA `/console/dashboard`               |\n"
msgid ""
"| Symptom                               | Common cause                                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Keyboard covers chat input            | WebView not resizing; need `adjustResize` + `@capacitor/keyboard`; `cap sync` after Web changes |\n"
"| Chat input unresponsive               | No selected conversation (first install should auto-create); or SAP disconnected                |\n"
"| Console load failed / Failed to fetch | Hub not `--host 0.0.0.0`, wrong token, firewall; Chrome Remote Debugging for Bearer header      |\n"
"| Not Found                             | Avoid legacy paths like `/console`/dashboard/index.html`; use SPA `/console`/dashboard`         |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 现象                              | 常见原因                                                                                 |\n"
"| ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 键盘遮挡聊天输入           | WebView 未调整大小；需 `adjustResize` + `@capacitor/keyboard`；Web 变更后 `cap sync` |\n"
"| 聊天输入无响应              | 未选中对话（首次安装应自动创建）；或 SAP 已断开             |\n"
"| 管理台加载失败 / Failed to fetch  | Hub 未 `--host 0.0.0.0`、token 错误、防火墙；Chrome 远程调试查看 Bearer 头   |\n"
"| Not Found                            | 避免旧路径如 `/console/dashboard/index.html`；使用 SPA `/console/dashboard`            |\n"

